1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Subs by Mkrm

2
00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:28,860
Whoa, so cool!

3
00:01:29,800 --> 00:01:31,740
Wow, what a mysterious gift!

4
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:34,140
If it's not "cool," then it's gotta be "Gong su"!

5
00:01:35,080 --> 00:01:36,990
Ah, "Gong su"?

6
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:38,460
Senior Brother, do you still remember me?

7
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:40,470
You were our School's Shotput Champion.

8
00:01:42,280 --> 00:01:42,780
How about that?

9
00:01:43,240 --> 00:01:46,140
Now I bet you can't even toss a pebble.

10
00:01:46,600 --> 00:01:47,500
Saint Qiao Team, huh?

11
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:49,500
Just a pair of pets.

12
00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:50,940
I was just looking for you.

13
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:58,000
Episode 29

14
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:01,980
Back then, I was very young, too.

15
00:02:03,100 --> 00:02:05,340
All I had were grand ambitions.

16
00:02:05,800 --> 00:02:07,740
Senior Brother, don't say that.

17
00:02:08,480 --> 00:02:10,110
Ever since then,

18
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:13,020
I've remembered your every word.

19
00:02:13,480 --> 00:02:16,380
"Strive for Excellence in everything, always push forward."

20
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:19,260
That's why I have a good career today.

21
00:02:21,440 --> 00:02:23,100
Senior Brother, you might not know,

22
00:02:23,560 --> 00:02:25,950
William is now in the same Profession as you.

23
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:28,380
He's a PE teacher at Saint Qiao High School now.

24
00:02:28,840 --> 00:02:30,300
And the benefits are pretty good, too.

25
00:02:30,760 --> 00:02:32,700
He's also well-recognized in his work.

26
00:02:34,300 --> 00:02:35,100
Really?

27
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:38,000
Not bad!

28
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:41,340
Saint Qiao High School,

29
00:02:41,900 --> 00:02:44,220
That's a Private Academy, wow.

30
00:02:45,160 --> 00:02:46,140
Oh, it's nothing...

31
00:02:46,600 --> 00:02:49,500
It's all thanks to your guidance, Senior Brother.

32
00:02:50,440 --> 00:02:52,380
Then you should toast Senior Brother again!

33
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:54,300
Yes, yes! Senior Brother!

34
00:02:54,760 --> 00:02:55,230
I can't drink anymore.

35
00:02:55,240 --> 00:02:56,190
Please, just one more.

36
00:02:56,200 --> 00:02:56,970
One more.

37
00:02:57,160 --> 00:02:58,140
I toast you again.

38
00:02:58,600 --> 00:02:59,580
Alright, come on, come on.

39
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:01,000
Bottom's up!

40
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:06,780
Coach Sarah!

41
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:09,180
Monica!

42
00:03:11,560 --> 00:03:13,020
Where did your Coach Tony go?

43
00:03:13,180 --> 00:03:15,520
Coach Tony had a date today, he went out.

44
00:03:16,530 --> 00:03:18,230
Oh, really?

45
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:20,700
No wonder his cellphone is always off.

46
00:03:21,640 --> 00:03:23,070
Our Coach Tony's phone

47
00:03:23,080 --> 00:03:24,540
is either out of battery or just off.

48
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:26,460
It's less useful than a lighter.

49
00:03:28,360 --> 00:03:29,340
Monica, if you see Coach Tony,

50
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:31,740
tell him I came looking for him.

51
00:03:32,200 --> 00:03:33,150
It's an Emergency.

52
00:03:33,160 --> 00:03:34,140
Okay, no problem.

53
00:03:34,600 --> 00:03:35,550
Thank you!

54
00:03:35,560 --> 00:03:36,540
You're welcome.

55
00:03:37,480 --> 00:03:37,980
Bye.

56
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:42,780
I wonder what Coach Tony's Zodiac sign is.

57
00:03:43,240 --> 00:03:45,230
He's having a lot of luck in love this month.

58
00:03:48,520 --> 00:03:49,500
Cheers.

59
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:50,940
I'll toast you another one.

60
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:55,260
It's fine, drink more.

61
00:03:55,380 --> 00:03:57,150
Come on.

62
00:03:57,160 --> 00:03:57,660
One more.

63
00:04:00,040 --> 00:04:01,020
You have to drink!

64
00:04:01,480 --> 00:04:01,980
Drink up, drink up.

65
00:04:02,440 --> 00:04:02,940
Thank you.

66
00:04:03,400 --> 00:04:03,900
Finish it!

67
00:04:39,880 --> 00:04:40,860
Oh, Senior Brother.

68
00:04:41,320 --> 00:04:44,220
I heard that Jianghai High has set
up some kind of YoYo School Team.

69
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:46,110
And that you're the Coach?

70
00:04:46,120 --> 00:04:49,020
Yeah.

71
00:04:50,440 --> 00:04:53,820
A Yo-Yo School Team called the Jianghai Team.

72
00:04:58,600 --> 00:05:00,060
How did you know that?

73
00:05:00,520 --> 00:05:02,430
Come on, do you know how famous you are?

74
00:05:02,440 --> 00:05:03,700
The whole City already knows.

75
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:06,780
Really?

76
00:05:11,080 --> 00:05:12,540
Last year, I wrote a

77
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:15,420
Secret Training Manual for Yo-Yos.

78
00:05:16,840 --> 00:05:19,260
But the Leadership at my School,

79
00:05:20,200 --> 00:05:22,590
the Principal didn't value it at all.

80
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:23,580
How could that be?

81
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:25,500
They were completely blind.

82
00:05:26,440 --> 00:05:28,860
Well, the Principal is busy.

83
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:30,780
Oh, Senior Brother.

84
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:33,180
back at the Sports Academy,

85
00:05:33,340 --> 00:05:34,590
you always came up with your own

86
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:36,510
unique Training Methods.

87
00:05:36,520 --> 00:05:38,940
I truly admire that.

88
00:05:41,320 --> 00:05:42,300
Senior Brother,

89
00:05:42,760 --> 00:05:45,660
could I take a look at that Secret Training Manual?

90
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:49,020
It might inspire me in my work.

91
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:52,380
Yeah. William just started working.

92
00:05:52,840 --> 00:05:54,780
Senior Brother, you really have to help him out.

93
00:05:56,200 --> 00:05:59,580
No problem, I'll show you.

94
00:06:06,460 --> 00:06:08,220
This is the one.

95
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:12,540
Your Saint Qiao High

96
00:06:13,180 --> 00:06:15,480
wouldn't be starting a Yo-Yo School Team, would they?

97
00:06:16,840 --> 00:06:17,820
No way, Senior Brother.

98
00:06:18,280 --> 00:06:20,220
Besides, William doesn't have that kind of ability.

99
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:22,430
Can I at least take a look?

100
00:06:23,740 --> 00:06:24,540
Sure.

101
00:06:29,600 --> 00:06:30,300
I'll look it over later.

102
00:06:30,760 --> 00:06:33,660
Hopefully this will help and inspire William.

103
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:36,540
Senior Brother, let me toast you another.

104
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:37,180
No, no no.

105
00:06:37,190 --> 00:06:39,390
I really can't anymore.

106
00:06:39,400 --> 00:06:40,350
Senior Brother.

107
00:06:40,360 --> 00:06:40,650
Just one more.

108
00:06:40,660 --> 00:06:41,650
I need the restroom.

109
00:06:42,280 --> 00:06:45,190
Senior Brother, I'll go with you.

110
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:48,060
I'll be fine.

111
00:06:55,240 --> 00:06:57,180
Faking my Birthday to fool him,

112
00:06:57,340 --> 00:06:59,100
don't ever pull a stunt like this again!

113
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:05,820
I won't let you down my dear sweetheart.

114
00:07:32,200 --> 00:07:34,620
Finally found the blue socks the horoscope hinted at.

115
00:07:34,780 --> 00:07:36,060
So lucky!

116
00:07:37,080 --> 00:07:37,980
Assistant!

117
00:07:39,880 --> 00:07:40,860
Stop!

118
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:44,190
What?

119
00:07:44,200 --> 00:07:45,660
These socks are mine.

120
00:07:46,400 --> 00:07:47,580
Why are they yours?

121
00:07:48,520 --> 00:07:49,980
I saw them first!

122
00:07:50,620 --> 00:07:52,860
That's too much! Just because you saw
them first doesn't make them yours.

123
00:07:53,320 --> 00:07:54,300
What about everything here?

124
00:07:54,460 --> 00:07:55,230
Should it all be yours.

125
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:57,270
I don't want anything else.

126
00:07:57,380 --> 00:07:58,630
I only want these socks.

127
00:07:58,680 --> 00:08:00,540
I want these socks too.

128
00:08:01,960 --> 00:08:02,940
So, who wants these socks?

129
00:08:03,400 --> 00:08:04,860
It's the last blue pair.

130
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:06,300
I saw them first. Give them to me.

131
00:08:06,460 --> 00:08:07,740
I grabbed them first, so they should go to me.

132
00:08:09,240 --> 00:08:10,620
What should we do, then?

133
00:08:11,740 --> 00:08:13,470
Oh, please, I'm begging you!

134
00:08:13,480 --> 00:08:14,460
Just let me have them.

135
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:16,860
These socks match my Team Uniform Color

136
00:08:17,320 --> 00:08:18,300
they're exactly the same.

137
00:08:18,760 --> 00:08:20,670
Team Uniform? What Team?

138
00:08:20,680 --> 00:08:22,140
I'm from Jianghai High's Yo-Yo school Team.

139
00:08:23,080 --> 00:08:25,500
Oh, you're from Jianghai High School!

140
00:08:25,660 --> 00:08:26,940
Your Team is amazing.

141
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:29,310
Is Mark on your Team?

142
00:08:29,320 --> 00:08:30,780
I'm a huge fan of his!

143
00:08:31,240 --> 00:08:33,060
Of course, Mark and I are Teammates now.

144
00:08:33,870 --> 00:08:34,620
Then at the next Competition,

145
00:08:35,080 --> 00:08:37,500
I can't wait to see an even more
amazing performance from you guys!

146
00:08:37,660 --> 00:08:38,940
That's right, please cheer us on.

147
00:08:39,680 --> 00:08:41,310
I'll definitely be rooting for you.

148
00:08:41,320 --> 00:08:42,750
Thanks, bye.

149
00:08:42,760 --> 00:08:43,740
Bye.

150
00:08:46,020 --> 00:08:47,100
These socks...

151
00:08:47,560 --> 00:08:48,990
Here, of course they're yours.

152
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:49,500
Thanks.

153
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:50,760
Bye.

154
00:09:12,520 --> 00:09:14,460
Hey, Jianghai Team?

155
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:18,300
Are you talking to me?

156
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:22,730
Seems like you're the only
Jianghai Team member around here.

157
00:09:25,280 --> 00:09:26,940
Do I know you?

158
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:28,860
Do we need to know each other?

159
00:09:29,800 --> 00:09:31,260
We just want to see what the

160
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:33,660
Jianghai Team's skills are like. That's all.

161
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:36,850
Oh, so you want to Challenge me to a Yo-Yo battle?

162
00:09:37,860 --> 00:09:38,840
Hmph, Keep dreaming.

163
00:09:39,680 --> 00:09:41,820
Our Jianghai Team doesn't just battle anyone on a whim.

164
00:09:42,280 --> 00:09:45,180
What a bunch of Losers, and yet they act so high and mighty.

165
00:09:45,640 --> 00:09:47,070
Don't try reverse psychology on me.

166
00:09:47,080 --> 00:09:48,510
Our Jianghai Team won't just randomly battle

167
00:09:48,520 --> 00:09:49,980
anyone out in the street.

168
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:52,860
The Jianghai Team's reputation

169
00:09:53,600 --> 00:09:55,230
must just be built on that loud mouth of yours.

170
00:09:55,240 --> 00:09:56,220
All bark and no bite.

171
00:09:57,640 --> 00:10:00,060
Loud thunder usually brings small raindrops.

172
00:10:00,520 --> 00:10:01,980
Hmph, not small raindrops,

173
00:10:02,920 --> 00:10:06,300
She's all thunder and absolutely no raindrops.

174
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:08,700
I told you earlier.

175
00:10:09,240 --> 00:10:10,140
A Team of Losers

176
00:10:10,400 --> 00:10:12,060
would never dare accept our Challenge.

177
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:14,460
You've done it now, Witch.

178
00:10:15,200 --> 00:10:16,860
Alright, how do you want to do this?

179
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:17,820
What did you say?

180
00:10:18,830 --> 00:10:20,230
Slow down, slow down.

181
00:10:22,600 --> 00:10:23,100
Senior Brother!

182
00:10:24,040 --> 00:10:26,460
How about I call a taxi for you?

183
00:10:27,680 --> 00:10:30,780
I like to go for a walk after drinking.

184
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:36,060
Senior Brother, we really learned a lot today.

185
00:10:38,440 --> 00:10:41,340
I hope it can be of some help to you.

186
00:10:41,800 --> 00:10:43,740
Alright, I'm off.

187
00:10:44,200 --> 00:10:45,180
Goodbye.

188
00:10:45,640 --> 00:10:46,620
I won't see you out, then.

189
00:10:47,560 --> 00:10:48,540
No need to see me out.

190
00:10:48,800 --> 00:10:49,600
Senior Brother!

191
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:50,910
Take care!

192
00:10:50,920 --> 00:10:51,900
Goodbye, Senior Brother.

193
00:10:52,360 --> 00:10:53,340
Take care!

194
00:11:01,180 --> 00:11:02,460
Are you happy now?

195
00:11:03,400 --> 00:11:05,770
Oh, don't be so mad. Come on, let's go.

196
00:11:06,460 --> 00:11:07,740
I'll take you shopping for clothes.

197
00:13:21,920 --> 00:13:23,100
Super Light Speed!

198
00:13:25,960 --> 00:13:27,420
Double Snake Fission!

199
00:13:40,640 --> 00:13:42,300
With those amateur skills,

200
00:13:42,760 --> 00:13:46,140
you dare to act out in front of me? Let's go.

201
00:13:47,080 --> 00:13:48,060
Hold it!

202
00:13:48,520 --> 00:13:49,500
Sneaking around like this,

203
00:13:49,960 --> 00:13:51,420
challenging the Jianghai Team— what skill does that prove?

204
00:13:51,880 --> 00:13:52,860
Let me tell you,

205
00:13:53,020 --> 00:13:53,820
You just faced the

206
00:13:54,280 --> 00:13:56,190
Jianghai Team's worst Member.

207
00:13:56,200 --> 00:13:58,140
You wouldn't even dare touch our other Players.

208
00:13:59,360 --> 00:14:01,500
I was just playing around with you today.

209
00:14:01,960 --> 00:14:02,940
It's just a little warning

210
00:14:03,400 --> 00:14:04,860
for your Jianghai Team.

211
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:08,220
In our eyes, your Jianghai Team

212
00:14:08,680 --> 00:14:10,620
is nothing but a joke.

213
00:14:11,560 --> 00:14:14,460
And by the way, take a message back.

214
00:14:15,400 --> 00:14:17,820
Every single member of the Jianghai Team

215
00:14:18,280 --> 00:14:20,220
is destined to lose to us.

216
00:14:21,820 --> 00:14:25,020
Oh, right, I forgot to tell you...

217
00:14:25,480 --> 00:14:27,420
I'm Cold Cat from Saint Qiao.

218
00:14:27,680 --> 00:14:29,340
I'm Hot Dog from Saint Qiao.

219
00:14:33,640 --> 00:14:36,030
What kind of freaks are these? Aliens?

220
00:14:36,040 --> 00:14:38,460
They're absolute monsters!

221
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:01,980
You're awake?

222
00:17:06,460 --> 00:17:08,220
What are you doing here?

223
00:17:09,160 --> 00:17:10,140
I should be asking you that.

224
00:17:10,980 --> 00:17:12,060
Why were you lying in the street?

225
00:17:13,480 --> 00:17:18,300
What? I was lying in the street?

226
00:17:23,080 --> 00:17:25,620
Who were you drinking with to get this wasted?

227
00:17:27,200 --> 00:17:28,830
It was our little Junior Sister,

228
00:17:28,840 --> 00:17:31,260
That brat, Dandan.

229
00:17:42,280 --> 00:17:43,260
You know, this thing called fate,

230
00:17:43,900 --> 00:17:45,180
it's really strange.

231
00:17:46,120 --> 00:17:48,060
Back then, she and William

232
00:17:48,520 --> 00:17:49,980
were at each other's throats all the time.

233
00:17:50,240 --> 00:17:51,420
Now they're a couple!

234
00:17:52,360 --> 00:17:53,340
William?

235
00:17:53,800 --> 00:17:55,260
Yeah, he's my Junior Brother.

236
00:17:55,720 --> 00:17:58,620
The one who won the Silver Medal
in the National Sprint.

237
00:17:59,560 --> 00:18:01,500
That kid really respects me.

238
00:18:02,440 --> 00:18:03,870
He said that something I told him back then

239
00:18:03,880 --> 00:18:05,340
changed his whole life.

240
00:18:06,760 --> 00:18:07,490
I was just about to warn you.

241
00:18:08,680 --> 00:18:09,180
William is now

242
00:18:09,820 --> 00:18:12,060
a PE teacher at Saint Qiao International High School.

243
00:18:12,320 --> 00:18:14,460
I know. He told me.

244
00:18:15,400 --> 00:18:17,340
That kid is doing pretty well for himself.

245
00:18:18,560 --> 00:18:19,740
He also wants to learn from me,

246
00:18:20,200 --> 00:18:22,140
for creating a customized Sports Training Program.

247
00:18:22,600 --> 00:18:23,580
He just lacks experience for now.

248
00:18:25,000 --> 00:18:27,420
So I gave him my Secret Yo-Yo Training Manual

249
00:18:27,880 --> 00:18:29,340
to have a look at.

250
00:18:29,640 --> 00:18:30,780
What?

251
00:18:31,520 --> 00:18:32,700
You gave him your Secret Manual?

252
00:18:33,040 --> 00:18:34,140
Yeah.

253
00:18:36,040 --> 00:18:37,980
I asked to borrow it to look
at and you wouldn't give it to me.

254
00:18:38,440 --> 00:18:39,900
And you just casually let someone else take it!

255
00:18:41,800 --> 00:18:42,780
Sarah,

256
00:18:43,720 --> 00:18:46,620
no matter how you put it, you and I are Rivals.

257
00:18:47,080 --> 00:18:48,540
Of course I couldn't let you see it.

258
00:18:49,000 --> 00:18:51,420
But William isn't into Yo-Yos. Right?

259
00:18:51,880 --> 00:18:53,820
Why don't you use your head for once?

260
00:18:54,000 --> 00:18:55,230
He hasn't contacted you for all these years,

261
00:18:55,240 --> 00:18:57,180
then suddenly shows up and flatters you.

262
00:18:57,640 --> 00:18:58,620
What do you think he's after?

263
00:19:01,280 --> 00:19:03,900
A Junior contacting his Senior,

264
00:19:05,120 --> 00:19:06,780
what's so strange about that?

265
00:19:09,160 --> 00:19:10,620
I went to your School today to find you

266
00:19:11,080 --> 00:19:12,060
to tell you that

267
00:19:13,000 --> 00:19:13,980
these past few days,

268
00:19:14,620 --> 00:19:17,340
Saint Qiao International High School
has already formed the Saint Qiao Team,

269
00:19:17,800 --> 00:19:19,740
and they've also signed up for this Yo-Yo competition.

270
00:19:20,680 --> 00:19:23,100
Tony, do you know who the Coach is?
- William!

271
00:19:24,520 --> 00:19:25,980
And the Saint Qiao Team's skill level is incredibly strong.

272
00:19:26,440 --> 00:19:28,380
They've already beaten our Team members twice.

273
00:19:29,120 --> 00:19:30,300
William?

274
00:19:32,380 --> 00:19:33,660
How could he?

275
00:19:34,120 --> 00:19:36,990
You always trust people so blindly,

276
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:38,460
and you never believe me.

277
00:19:40,840 --> 00:19:42,300
How could that be?

278
00:19:43,680 --> 00:19:45,180
Sobered up now?

279
00:19:45,440 --> 00:19:46,140
Yeah.

280
00:19:46,400 --> 00:19:47,580
I'm leaving.

281
00:19:48,040 --> 00:19:49,020
Hey, no...

282
00:20:25,000 --> 00:20:25,980
Captain!

283
00:20:26,440 --> 00:20:28,860
We got the Secret Manual you wanted.

284
00:20:31,420 --> 00:20:32,700
Leave it here.

285
00:20:55,900 --> 00:20:56,700
Matthew!

286
00:20:57,160 --> 00:20:57,660
Matthew!

287
00:20:58,120 --> 00:20:59,070
Matthew!

288
00:20:59,080 --> 00:21:00,060
What's up with you?

289
00:21:00,220 --> 00:21:01,500
I've been calling you forever with no response.

290
00:21:01,960 --> 00:21:02,910
You called me? I didn't hear you.

291
00:21:02,920 --> 00:21:03,900
Even during break,

292
00:21:04,360 --> 00:21:05,820
you were over there mumbling and giggling to yourself.

293
00:21:06,280 --> 00:21:07,260
What were you thinking about?

294
00:21:07,720 --> 00:21:10,110
Did you win the lottery, or find some money?

295
00:21:10,120 --> 00:21:11,580
No, nothing like that.

296
00:21:11,640 --> 00:21:12,990
Well, I've got something for you. Come with me.

297
00:21:13,000 --> 00:21:14,940
No, I can't. I have something else. Another time.

298
00:21:15,580 --> 00:21:16,860
What's wrong with you?

299
00:21:16,920 --> 00:21:19,230
First you said nothing, then you say you're busy.

300
00:21:19,240 --> 00:21:20,700
I really do have something to do!

